# NOCA -- Worker pause/resume command secret
#
# The HMAC key Arena signs pause/resume commands with and the queue-consuming
# workers verify. Rating never pauses and does not read it.
#
# Loaded by: aiassistant, arena, autojudge, mailer
# Reference: docs/CONFIG.md -- layer map: docs/ENV_LAYERS.md

# (empty) Shared secret for the HMAC-SHA256 pause/resume commands. Leave empty to disable
# the signed command channel: workers then reconcile their pause state from PostgreSQL on
# their normal poll instead of being nudged, which is slower but never wrong.
NOCA_WORKER_COMMAND_SECRET=
